includes: Three things. (1) GUI wobble fixed + fully adaptive bio strip: the top HR/HRV/Br/Coh strip no longer jumps when a value's digit-count changes or the source tag toggles between "PPG" and "Cover camera". It's now four equal-width cells that always fit, with monospaced digits, a bounded source-tag slot, and text that scales down on small phones — stable and adaptive to every iPhone size, portrait and landscape. (The rest of the app was already ScrollView-based and adaptive; no fixed widths or UIScreen usage.) (2) AUv3 plugin state save/recall: a hosted instrument or insert effect now returns exactly as you left it — its full settings are saved on unload/replace/background and recalled on load. (3) EchoelFX now uses the same card style (EchoelTheme.fill rows) as the rest of the app — one consistent look. Verified: Xcode Compile Check + CI green.
